1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,220
Official public health notification regarding emerging viral respiratory pathogen H5-V2. Rapid containment protocols are active.

2
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:19,180
Transmission occurs via fine aerosol droplets with an estimated basic reproduction rate exceeding 3.2 in indoor environments.

3
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:26,470
All presenting patients showing severe hypoxemia must be placed in negative pressure isolation immediately.
